  "notes": "Warm off-white paper background (#faf8f4) with hairline beige dividers (#e7e2d9) gives an editorial, stationery feel to an otherwise plain admin table. Serif wordmark/H1 contrasts with small uppercase tracked sans labels. Status/fulfillment shown as fully rounded pills: neutral outline for PAID/UNFULFILLED, pale green fill with green text for FULFILLED. Public IDs in monospace blue links; emails truncated with ellipsis. Sort is server-side via URL params with a ↓ arrow appended to the active header (not shown in default capture). Filters are native selects requiring Apply; filed proposal for an 'inline-dropdown-bar' placement value. No icons except text arrows (← View store)."
